{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"079eb557068409806d3ea2f15aa4026b","RawContent":"good morning everyone,\n \n so it looks like im gonna have to wait till at least sept to book and look at prices again.\n \n i really need your advice everyone do you think its ok to wait till sept or later to book if we plane on getting married in may 2009 or maybe june 2009? did anyone ever book 6 month in advance? any tips or info i would really appreciated.\n \n thank you all :)","Attachments":[],"Id":271156,"PostDate":1208442371,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                good morning everyone,<br \/> <br \/> so it looks like im gonna have to wait till at least sept to book and look at prices again.<br \/> <br \/> i really need your advice everyone do you think its ok to wait till sept or later to book if we plane on getting married in may 2009 or maybe june 2009? did anyone ever book 6 month in advance? any tips or info i would really appreciated.<br \/> <br \/> thank you all <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"enabella@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1207679312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209046.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"enabella","Id":209046,"Name":"enabella","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97e6cd0d295261b762af8bdf184a908f","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;MrsPetti2Be&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;The other option is that you guys could stay at the palace and all your family can stay at another riu that is cheap like the Bambu (i think this is a 4 star). The only issue with that is you have to get married at the resort where 80% of the guests are staying...or you can get married at the palace punta cana and the guests not staying there have to pay like $100 each to attend the wedding and reception. Or you can check out the Riu Palace Macao...it is also very nice and a little cheaper but not as much as the bambu.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n Enabella, \n Def take what Mrs. Petti takes into account. If you stay at a different Riu than th guests, you will actually have to pay for them to attend the wedding (which is nuts, I know). I have stayed at RIU properties before and they are nice! When we were researching our wedding though we nixed this one because of the pricing on packages and the amount of people coming to our wedding (and also the day passes pricing -- for people coming to the wedding but staying at another resort altogether...yes they DO make you pay for that, individually). \n Just do your research and if this one matches what you want, go for it!\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile29\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":271202,"PostDate":1208443582,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>MrsPetti2Be<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">The other option is that you guys could stay at the palace and all your family can stay at another riu that is cheap like the Bambu (i think this is a 4 star). The only issue with that is you have to get married at the resort where 80% of the guests are staying...or you can get married at the palace punta cana and the guests not staying there have to pay like $100 each to attend the wedding and reception. Or you can check out the Riu Palace Macao...it is also very nice and a little cheaper but not as much as the bambu.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> Enabella, <br \/> Def take what Mrs. Petti takes into account. If you stay at a different Riu than th guests, you will actually have to pay for them to attend the wedding (which is nuts, I know). I have stayed at RIU properties before and they are nice! When we were researching our wedding though we nixed this one because of the pricing on packages and the amount of people coming to our wedding (and also the day passes pricing -- for people coming to the wedding but staying at another resort altogether...yes they DO make you pay for that, individually). <br \/> Just do your research and if this one matches what you want, go for it!<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile29\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cmmdee@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1187868242,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207666.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Copita","Id":207666,"Name":"Copita","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ac5c0499662caf74dd3a464307c9119","RawContent":"if you stay a different resort than the guests you wouldn&#039;t have to pay for them to attend you would have to have the wedding wherever they are staying...the rule of thumb for all Riu resorts is that the wedding must be held where 80% of the guests are staying. So you guys could do the Riu Palace and get that experience and the rest of the guests can stay at any 1 of the other 5 Riu properties (they are all right next to each other). And because you are at the Palace Punta Cana you can use all 5 of the resorts but they cannot use your resort.","Attachments":[],"Id":272909,"PostDate":1208547184,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                if you stay a different resort than the guests you wouldn't have to pay for them to attend you would have to have the wedding wherever they are staying...the rule of thumb for all Riu resorts is that the wedding must be held where 80% of the guests are staying. So you guys could do the Riu Palace and get that experience and the rest of the guests can stay at any 1 of the other 5 Riu properties (they are all right next to each other). And because you are at the Palace Punta Cana you can use all 5 of the resorts but they cannot use your resort.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/RiXkm4\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/RiXkm4\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lisalay6@cogeco.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1207252458,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209008.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsPetti2Be","Id":209008,"Name":"MrsPetti2Be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aaaaec38e7c0b36072afc505f3c67cb4","RawContent":"thanks ladies for the advice.\n since prices for next year are way out of our budget and our guests looks like i have no choice but to wait till maybe sept and see if the prices drop a little mean while im gonna look for a less luxury hotel in punta cana and that might help the situation .\n \n do you girls have any suggestions for a decent hotel?","Attachments":[],"Id":274439,"PostDate":1208729054,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                thanks ladies for the advice.<br \/> since prices for next year are way out of our budget and our guests looks like i have no choice but to wait till maybe sept and see if the prices drop a little mean while im gonna look for a less luxury hotel in punta cana and that might help the situation .<br \/> <br \/> do you girls have any suggestions for a decent hotel?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"enabella@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1207679312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209046.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"enabella","Id":209046,"Name":"enabella","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26a834960b319a6a905e7cadf81d1225","RawContent":"The dreams punta cana looks like a nice resort and I believe it is cheaper than the Riu Palace. The Riu bambu also looked nice and is a lot cheaper than the Palace. I have also heard some good reviews about the Ocean Blue and I believe it is cheaper.","Attachments":[],"Id":275630,"PostDate":1208807693,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The dreams punta cana looks like a nice resort and I believe it is cheaper than the Riu Palace. The Riu bambu also looked nice and is a lot cheaper than the Palace. I have also heard some good reviews about the Ocean Blue and I believe it is cheaper.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/RiXkm4\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/RiXkm4\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lisalay6@cogeco.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1207252458,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209008.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsPetti2Be","Id":209008,"Name":"MrsPetti2Be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b374ba341f111e6f539734939da89ed","RawContent":"thanks you mrsp :) im going to try to look and get prices and hopefully ill have better luck","Attachments":[],"Id":276385,"PostDate":1208869662,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                thanks you mrsp <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> im going to try to look and get prices and hopefully ill have better luck\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"enabella@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1207679312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209046.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"enabella","Id":209046,"Name":"enabella","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5338e2f077a699eb027dd12427e985c7","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;enabella&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;thanks ladies for the advice.\n since prices for next year are way out of our budget and our guests looks like i have no choice but to wait till maybe sept and see if the prices drop a little mean while im gonna look for a less luxury hotel in punta cana and that might help the situation .\n \n do you girls have any suggestions for a decent hotel?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I&#039;m in your same situation (June 2009)! I went online to funjet today to see if I could get prices. Of course I couldn&#039;t for my dates. But, we weren&#039;t planning on booking anything until August anyways due to us wanting to save more money first. Which still gives everyone eight months to pay in full. I feel since everyone already knows we are doing a destination wedding they should be saving as of now. So money shouldn&#039;t be an issue. I know that is a little selfish but it is my wedding day!! Not sure if that helps you are not. Just my two cents!","Attachments":[],"Id":277374,"PostDate":1208902641,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>enabella<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">thanks ladies for the advice.<br \/> since prices for next year are way out of our budget and our guests looks like i have no choice but to wait till maybe sept and see if the prices drop a little mean while im gonna look for a less luxury hotel in punta cana and that might help the situation .<br \/> <br \/> do you girls have any suggestions for a decent hotel?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I'm in your same situation (June 2009)! I went online to funjet today to see if I could get prices. Of course I couldn't for my dates. But, we weren't planning on booking anything until August anyways due to us wanting to save more money first. Which still gives everyone eight months to pay in full. I feel since everyone already knows we are doing a destination wedding they should be saving as of now. So money shouldn't be an issue. I know that is a little selfish but it is my wedding day!! Not sure if that helps you are not. Just my two cents!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"thecurlyfitchic@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1207661284,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209041.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FYB87","Id":209041,"Name":"FYB87","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d21eb33f0b61c94ee104975de3996eb5","RawContent":"I am also in the same situation as you!\n \n My FH are trying to come up with a rough figure that each of our guests will need to pay, but it&#039;s hard to do that with no airfare prices! My travel agent told me that prices will be available in May or June! \n \n How soon after you book the hotel do you have to pay in full for your wedding?","Attachments":[],"Id":279542,"PostDate":1209042346,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am also in the same situation as you!<br \/> <br \/> My FH are trying to come up with a rough figure that each of our guests will need to pay, but it's hard to do that with no airfare prices! My travel agent told me that prices will be available in May or June! <br \/> <br \/> How soon after you book the hotel do you have to pay in full for your wedding?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/KICCm5\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/KICCm5\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"evtalbot@aim.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1208620224,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209142.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":88,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"evtalbot","Id":209142,"Name":"evtalbot","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1426e09742add52aeca6ed3dcc402a99","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;evtalbot&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;\n How soon after you book the hotel do you have to pay in full for your wedding?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;It totally depends on the resort. Some resorts dont even require a deposit, you just pay for everything when you get there and meet with the WC to make your final decisions. Other resorts require a deposit and you just pay the balance upon arrival as well.","Attachments":[],"Id":279549,"PostDate":1209042580,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>evtalbot<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\"><br \/> How soon after you book the hotel do you have to pay in full for your wedding?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>It totally depends on the resort. Some resorts dont even require a deposit, you just pay for everything when you get there and meet with the WC to make your final decisions. Other resorts require a deposit and you just pay the balance upon arrival as well.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>2 Hearts, 1 Love 08.08.08Punta Cana, D.R.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rchristinah@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1183296115,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207507.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":91,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"twinkletoes","Id":207507,"Name":"twinkletoes","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74318cba185af669c2a3a51eb25fe9cf","RawContent":"Enabella, if price is really such a huge issue, why doesn&#039;t your FI&#039;s family wait to book because the prices will go down.\n \n When we were quoted $1650+230tax to go to Mayan for our wedding we booked only the 10 required people to secure our group. Everyone else ended up paying $1100+277 tax when they booked in Sept.","Attachments":[],"Id":279855,"PostDate":1209051979,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Enabella, if price is really such a huge issue, why doesn't your FI's family wait to book because the prices will go down.<br \/> <br \/> When we were quoted $1650+230tax to go to Mayan for our wedding we booked only the 10 required people to secure our group. Everyone else ended up paying $1100+277 tax when they booked in Sept.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alla.lubimskaya@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1191030806,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207800.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Allaballa","Id":207800,"Name":"Allaballa","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":33,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
